bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Login Page" as UI
boundary Router
control AuthController
control AuthService
boundary HashUtil
boundary JwtService

User -> UI: 1. Enter email & password\nClick Login
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /api/auth/login (loginDto)
activate Router

Router -> AuthController: 3. login(loginDto)
activate AuthController

AuthController -> AuthService: 4. login(loginDto)
activate AuthService

ref over AuthService: 3.5.b.i. Subsequence - Find user for email login

AuthService -> AuthService: 5. Check user
activate AuthService
space
deactivate AuthService

opt Invalid user
    AuthService --> AuthController: 5.1. Throw BadRequestException
    AuthController --> Router: 5.2. HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 5.3. Show error
    UI --> User: 5.4. Invalid credentials
end

AuthService -> HashUtil: 6. Compare password
activate HashUtil
HashUtil --> AuthService: 7. Result
deactivate HashUtil

opt Password mismatch
    AuthService --> AuthController: 7.1. Throw BadRequestException
    AuthController --> Router: 7.2. HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 7.3. Show error
    UI --> User: 7.4. Invalid credentials
end

AuthService -> JwtService: 8. Generate JWT access token
activate JwtService
JwtService --> AuthService: 9. Result
deactivate JwtService

AuthService --> AuthController: 10. Return token & payload
deactivate AuthService

AuthController --> Router: 11. Set-Cookie
deactivate AuthController

Router --> UI: 12. Login success 
deactivate Router

UI --> User: 13. Redirect to home page
deactivate UI
deactivate User
@enduml